## 🤖 AI Integration

Integrated an AI layer into the Sentinel-View cybersecurity threat detection pipeline.

The AI component is designed to analyze detected security events and generate meaningful explanations for SOC analysts.

### 🔹 AI Capabilities

- Analyze detected security events
- Explain why an event may be suspicious
- Generate human-readable threat explanations
- Provide investigation suggestions for security analysts
- Support incident summarization
- Prepare the system for future remediation recommendations

### 🔹 Integration Flow

Security Event
      ↓
FastAPI Detection API
      ↓
Threat Analyzer
      ↓
Threat Score
      ↓
Severity Classification
      ↓
AI Engine
      ↓
AI-Generated Explanation

### 🧰 Technologies

- Python
- FastAPI
- Ollama / OpenAI
- AI-powered threat analysis
- REST API

This integration is an important step toward building an **AI-assisted SOC platform** capable of helping analysts understand and investigate cybersecurity incidents more efficiently.
